Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:18.57,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:22.37,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.48,0:01:26.82,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:29.10,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.11,0:01:31.86,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:34.16,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:39.08,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:43.25,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:48.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:48.04,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:52.67,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:51.91,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:52.57,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:53.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:58.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:57.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:01:58.05,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:01:59.29,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:03.76,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:07.19,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:09.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:10.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:13.03,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.45,0:02:11.98,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:16.00,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:15.74,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:18.68,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:18.24,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:20.99,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.07,0:02:23.58,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
